WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:08.782
While Christine and Raoul were visiting the seaside town, the opera house managers were investigating the

2
00:00:08.783 --> 00:00:16.218
ghost. One morning the two men cautiously entered the dark, deserted theater and looked up at

3
00:00:16.219 --> 00:00:22.497
box five. "Did you see what I just saw?" Moncharmin whispered, grabbing Richard's arm. "Yes, a

4
00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:27.618
woman who looks like that usher we fired, Madame Giry." "No! A skull resting on the

5
00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:36.226
front ledge of the box! Whatever it was, it disappeared!" The two partners raced up to

6
00:00:36.227 --> 00:00:46.642
box five. They searched that box and the ones next to it but found neither woman

7
