Saturday night we must watch the Faust performance from box five," Richard said. His partner nodded

9
00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:09.257
in agreement. *** On Saturday morning the managers found a letter from the opera ghost in

10
00:01:09.258 --> 00:01:13.284
their office. Moncharmin moaned as he skimmed the letter. "What does he want this time?" Richard

11
