25
00:02:49.362 --> 00:02:58.735
grooms and complain to the police about the ghost. Good day." When Lachenel left, Richard said,

26
00:02:58.736 --> 00:03:05.370
"He's the one who should be fired." As soon as the managers agreed upon that, Madame

27
