Giry arrived with the ghost's letter about his monthly allowance. The managers immediately threw her out

28
00:03:13.584 --> 00:03:17.232
of their office. *** About the same time, Carlotta was lying in bed, reading her mail.

29
00:03:17.233 --> 00:03:22.739
She opened a note penned in red ink. If you appear onstage tonight, be prepared for

30
00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:37.384
a terrible misfortune—a misfortune worse than death. The unsigned note took away Carlotta's appetite for breakfast.

31
00:03:37.385 --> 00:03:46.930
But as the hours passed, she realized what was happening. "One of Christine's fans must be

32
00:03:46.931 --> 00:03:54.493
trying to frighten me out of performing tonight, so she can play Marguerite!" Carlotta thought. At

33
