sold a lot of tickets for tonight, which is pretty good for an opera house with

43
00:05:12.464 --> 00:05:19.170
a curse on it!" Richard pointed to a couple sitting in the middle of the theater

44
00:05:19.171 --> 00:05:29.568
below. "Do you see that woman? I've just hired her to replace Madame Giry as the

45
00:05:29.569 --> 00:05:39.117
usher for this box. She's never been to the opera before, so I wanted her to

46
00:05:39.118 --> 00:05:46.451
have a good seat." "Let's hope she doesn't believe in ghosts." Moncharmin glanced at the people

47
00:05:46.452 --> 00:05:51.257
sitting in the box directly across from box five. "I recognize Phillipe, the Count de Chagny,

48
00:05:51.258 --> 00:06:00.437
but who's that pale young man sitting next to him?" "That's his brother, Raoul. He looks

49
00:06:00.438 --> 00:06:10.143
ill, doesn't he?" Moncharmin nodded as the second act began. It passed as smoothly as the

50
00:06:10.144 --> 00:06:12.726
first, and Carlotta sang without incident. The managers briefly left their box during intermission. When they

51
00:06:14.134 --> 00:06:17.375
returned, they noticed a box of English candy on a little shelf. They glanced at each

52
00:06:17.376 --> 00:06:23.505
other uneasily. "Who put that here?" Richard demanded. "Remember what Madame Giry said about the

53
00:06:23.506 --> 00:06:28.598
ghost's tips?" Moncharmin whispered. Of course Richard remembered, but he was too rattled to say anything.

54
00:06:28.599 --> 00:06:33.313
The managers were not the only ones haunted by events at the opera that night. As

55
00:06:33.314 --> 00:06:46.225
Christine sang, she spotted Raoul in his brother's box, and her voice faltered. Raoul put his

56
00:06:46.226 --> 00:06:51.237
head in his hands and wept, while Philippe fumed. Raoul had returned from a mysterious journey

57
00:06:51.238 --> 00:06:56.830
in poor health. When Philippe contacted Christine for an explanation, she refused to see him. "That

58
00:06:56.831 --> 00:07:02.447
little schemer," Philippe thought. "What does she want from my brother?" Meanwhile Raoul thought only of

59
00:07:02.448 --> 00:07:07.468
the note he'd received from Christine: If you love me, please do not see me or

60
00:07:07.469 --> 00:07:21.639
speak to me again. Both of our lives depend upon it. My dear Raoul, I will

61
00:07:22.245 --> 00:07:31.036
never forget you. Carlotta thought of the threatening note she'd received, but encouraged by the presence

62
00:07:31.037 --> 00:07:47.494
of her many fans, she sang with confidence. The audience applauded thunderously for the diva whose

63
